  "protocol": "Freeze before timed samples: tag v0.2.9 against candidate; compiler Rust 1.87.0 default --release, no RUSTFLAGS; identical library build directory and runner across arms. Unmodified tests/audio/mapped/family{1-3ch,1-6ch,255-8ch}-gain0.opus (2,4,8 elementary streams): rewind by constructing a new MultistreamDecoder per complete six-packet clip, public decode at 48 kHz, mapped PCM and ranges black_box. 128 file passes per timed run after 8 warmup passes, timing reads Linux /proc/thread-self/schedstat; no input I/O in timed region. 20 paired rounds per fixture alternating arm order by (round+case) parity; rotate case order by round; pin all timed processes to CPU6. For each round and case compute after/before; equal-weight geometric average over cells/rounds; bootstrap paired rounds 20,000 times seed 111 for 95% percentile intervals. Accept only if upper aggregate ratio <1, all three cell upper limits <=1.05 and all PCM samples and per-packet final ranges compare equal. Qualification separately writes all i16le output and per-packet range+length for bytewise comparison.",
